{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">再有香港人在北海道自駕遊出意外，一名53歲香港女子死亡。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1184136-%E4%BA%94%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%A7%E5%86%8D%E6%9C%89%E6%B8%AF%E4%BA%BA%E5%8C%97%E6%B5%B7%E9%81%93%E8%87%AA%E9%A7%95%E9%81%8A%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%9653%E6%AD%B2%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%97%E5%82%B7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">五天內再有港人北海道自駕遊出意外　53歲香港女子死亡多人受傷</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">人稱「何伯」的何煊在公眾地方與妻子打鬥，判入獄兩個月。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1184103-%E4%BD%95%E4%BC%AF%E8%88%87%E5%A6%BB%E6%89%93%E9%AC%A5%E5%88%A4%E5%9B%9A%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E5%AE%98%E6%8C%87%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%B6%89%E5%9B%A0%E6%84%9B%E6%88%90%E6%81%A8%E5%86%80%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%BE%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%BF%83%E9%A4%8A%E6%80%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">「何伯」與妻打鬥判囚兩個月　官指案件涉因愛成恨冀被告日後修心養性</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">一輛城巴早上在屯門公路近深井失控撞欄，十名乘客受傷送院治理，巴士司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1184089-%E5%9F%8E%E5%B7%B4%E5%B1%AF%E9%96%80%E5%85%AC%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%91%E6%B7%B1%E4%BA%95%E6%92%9E%E6%AC%84%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%97%E5%82%B7%E9%80%81%E9%99%A2%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E6%B6%89%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">城巴屯門公路近深井撞欄十人受傷送院　巴士司機涉危險駕駛被捕</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br/><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">六合彩暑期金多寶今晚攪珠，若10元一注獨中，估計頭獎達一億元，刷新暑期金多寶頭獎紀錄。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1184102-%E5%85%AD%E5%90%88%E5%BD%A9%E8%8B%A510%E5%85%83%E4%B8%80%E6%B3%A8%E7%8D%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%99%E9%A0%AD%E7%8D%8E%E6%B4%BE%E5%BD%A9%E9%81%94%E4%B8%80%E5%84%84%E5%85%83%E5%88%B7%E6%96%B0%E6%9A%91%E6%9C%9F%E9%87%91%E5%A4%9A%E5%AF%B6%E9%A0%AD%E7%8D%8E%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">六合彩｜若10元一注獨中料頭獎派彩達一億元　刷新暑期金多寶頭獎紀錄</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">警方過去兩星期在港島打擊三合會，拘捕78人；在跑馬地馬場搗破一個非法外圍賭博集團。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">➤</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1184088-%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E6%B8%AF%E5%B3%B6%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A%E4%B8%89%E5%90%88%E6%9C%83%E6%8B%9878%E4%BA%BA%E8%B7%91%E9%A6%AC%E5%9C%B0%E9%A6%AC%E5%A0%B4%E6%90%97%E7%A0%B4%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%96%E5%9C%8D%E8%B3%AD%E5%8D%9A%E9%9B%86%E5%9C%98\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">警方港島打擊三合會拘78人　跑馬地馬場搗破非法外圍賭博集團</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(旁述由AI生成)</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T10:58:35.868631+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}